---
title: WebGL cannot be initialized
...

You browser supports WebGL but it can't be setup.

If the browser supports WebGL but it can't be initialized then WebGL failed for some reason other than user's browser (no GPU, out of memory, etc...)
Another reason can be caused my multiple open browser tabs.

For further troubleshooting information please refer to the [WebGL official doku](https://www.khronos.org/webgl/wiki/FAQ).
